[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10860.07, "timestamp": "03:01:00", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10861.83, "timestamp": "03:01:01", "text": "说实话，我其实更喜欢烤饼而不是其他东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10864.389, "timestamp": "03:01:04", "text": "大米最多。我小时候用过。现在我更喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10866.63, "timestamp": "03:01:06", "text": "米饭，但我以前更喜欢吃烤饼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10869.59, "timestamp": "03:01:09", "text": "孩子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10873.83, "timestamp": "03:01:13", "text": "是的，我们很正规。听着，这很好。印度烤饼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10882.79, "timestamp": "03:01:22", "text": "我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10885.19, "timestamp": "03:01:25", "text": "一旦你了解了，就会发现这个笑话简直太离谱了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10889.19, "timestamp": "03:01:29", "text": "他。精神错乱。什么是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10892.23, "timestamp": "03:01:32", "text": "就像你知道你知道的那样？好的。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10894.15, "timestamp": "03:01:34", "text": "我不知道查德是否知道这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10896.15, "timestamp": "03:01:36", "text": "你跟查德说过你的VR经历吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10898.389, "timestamp": "03:01:38", "text": "冒险？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10900.55, "timestamp": "03:01:40", "text": "虚拟现实冒险。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10904.389, "timestamp": "03:01:44", "text": "VR 房屋。是的。哦，我的意思是，我告诉我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10909.59, "timestamp": "03:01:49", "text": "我猜当时是直播。是的。所以，我，我，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10911.51, "timestamp": "03:01:51", "text": "我想要这个，我想要设置这个，我想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10915.19, "timestamp": "03:01:55", "text": "给你们描述一下场景。好的。所以，呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10919.349, "timestamp": "03:01:59", "text": "Jo、Mura、Iman、京都，他们都在"}]